      "writtenOn": "2016-05-25T17:23:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So the concern is:\n- some has created a customer shadow user driver based on the Mitaka code\n- we have committee that they can continue to use this driver for 2 cycles\n- they upgrade to Newton...and use their driver...\n- won\u0027t the manager now go bang!\n- If so, then that\u0027s what the wrapper is for - to fake up any new methods so that they either are silent, or fake the new functionality in a non-perfmant way...etc....basically so the new manager doesn\u0027t have to have knowledge of older drivers....",
      "parentUuid": "bab6814e_736e61ca",
      "revId": "ad568868d0d9178ade1a8b319960d424ab5d5697",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
